---
import ManagerLayout from '../../layouts/ManagerLayout.astro';
import ManagerAccess from '../../components/ManagerAccess.astro';
---
<ManagerLayout title="Товары" active="products"><section data-workspace="products"><header class="dash-header"><div><p class="dash-eyebrow">Каталог и наполнение</p><h1>Товары</h1></div><button type="button" class="dash-button" data-workspace-refresh>Обновить</button></header><ManagerAccess/><div data-workspace-content hidden><div class="mgr-filter-panel"><label class="dash-field mgr-search">Найти товар<input data-product-search type="search" placeholder="Название товара"/></label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input data-product-incomplete type="checkbox"/>Только незаполненные</label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input data-product-demo type="checkbox"/>Демонстрационные</label></div><section class="dash-panel"><div class="dash-section-head"><h2>Каталог</h2><span data-product-count></span></div><p class="dash-help">Товар редактируется в CMS. Здесь видны статус и данные, которые требуют заполнения.</p><div class="dash-quality-list" data-product-list></div><p class="dash-empty" data-product-empty hidden>Товары не найдены.</p><nav class="mgr-pagination" data-product-pagination aria-label="Страницы товаров"></nav></section></div></section><script>import '../../scripts/manager-products';</script></ManagerLayout>
